    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρος</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας</span>
			, not found in nom., gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Int.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Arch.</u>
				1913.247
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Selymbria</span>), dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					15.15
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρεϊ</span>
			v.l. ap.Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.150
			</span></i>. (These forms are also found as vv. ll. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήραος, γήραϊ</span>.)</div>
